docs {
  # Update Shop

  Update an existing shop's fields.

  Only include the fields you want to update in the request body.

  ## Example: Mark Shop as Occupied

  ```json
  {
    "status": "Occupied",
    "tenant": "TENANT-001"
  }
  ```

  ## Example Response

  ```json
  {
    "data": {
      "name": "SHOP-001",
      "status": "Occupied",
      "tenant": "TENANT-001",
      // ... other fields
    }
  }
  ```
}
